  },
  "he:Yotzerot/Parashat HaChodesh:54": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b><b><small> מודים דרבנן<small><b><small>בחזרת הש\"ץ</small>",
     "kind": "instruction",
     "en": "In the chazzan's repetition, when he says Modim, the congregation says:",
     "gloss": "Instruction for Modim d'Rabbanan"
    },
    {
     "text": "</b> כשהוא אומר מודים,",
     "kind": "instruction",
     "en": "In the chazzan's repetition, when he says Modim, the congregation says:",
     "gloss": "Instruction for Modim d'Rabbanan"
    },
    {
     "text": " אומרים הקהל:</small> </small></b></b>",
     "kind": "instruction",
     "en": "In the chazzan's repetition, when he says Modim, the congregation says:",
     "gloss": "Instruction for Modim d'Rabbanan"
    }
   ]
